# Commands inside choice branches

--- path: buy_potion
[command give_gold(1) = mock]
[command play_sound(1) = mock]
> What do you want?
[advance]
? Buy potion | Leave
[choice 0]
! command give_gold(-50)
! command play_sound("purchase")
> Here's your potion!
! done

--- path: leave
[command give_gold(1) = mock]
[command play_sound(1) = mock]
> What do you want?
[advance]
? Buy potion | Leave
[choice 1]
> Goodbye!
! done
